{
  "method": "Market- and direction-specific regularized logistic models, fit to preceding three-month chart-window features. For each test year, coefficients are fitted using outcomes completed before the preceding two-year validation period; thresholds are chosen on that validation period, with outcomes completed before the test year. Calls in both directions conflict and are withheld. Monthly signal close versus first close on or after three calendar months, no more than ten days late. Ties are misses. Strictly chronological, but not a new untouched holdout.",
  "features": [
    "trend_score",
    "return_5",
    "return_20",
    "window_return",
    "volatility",
    "range_position",
    "unchanged_fraction"
  ],
  "years": [
    2016,
    2017,
    2018,
    2019,
    2020,
    2021,
    2022,
    2023,
    2024,
    2025,
    2026
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Exploratory historical data, overlapping outcomes and correlated market shocks; bootstrap intervals are approximate and not corrected for model/threshold search.",
    "Present-day selected universe omits many delisted assets. Outcome data may contain corporate-action distortions, and a same-close entry may not be executable.",
    "No dividends, fees, taxes or slippage; a price-direction forecast is not a trading return. Crypto validation is Yahoo, not the app's Binance feed.",
    "Short or missing windows and delayed exits are excluded, not negative observations. No bond yields or funds are evaluated.",
    "Live partial daily bars, staleness, market identification, and chart/table parity have not been validated; models are not deployed."
  ],
